# The agent-atlas commit a deploy enumerates against. One sha per line; first wins.
# Bump it in a hestia commit when the registry gains something a seat should discover --
# so the universe changes when main says so, not when a registry commit happens to land.
# Bumped 2026-09-21: agent-atlas #1 merged -- talk-to/sage, the registry's first
# `kind: being`. Until this line moved, no seat enumerated `sage` FROM THE ATLAS.
# Bumped 2026-09-28: agent-atlas #2 merged -- hooks/<provider>/descriptor.md, which agent-inventory
# qualifies every hook against (#1144). At the old pin the deployed inventory has no hooks/ dir,
# so every non-hestia hook reads unqualified.
e13dc6e972bbad6b0040acf9249faace452b7d36
